00:04:37.917 --> 00:04:42.577
The Pentagon Inspector General's Office declined a request from U.S. Senators to investigate

00:04:42.577 --> 00:04:45.397
restrictions on the Ukraine military's use of the network.

00:04:45.937 --> 00:04:50.397
An Inspector General Platmoring told them the questions should go to the U.S. Air Force

00:04:50.397 --> 00:04:51.217
